From 4bb2732e711dd86ae5e35afafc51ae3d2b4b8cba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:50:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): align saved class consumers with independent
 dynamic review [daveey]

Source-linked dispatched implementation receipts replace evidence-free review fixtures; preserve current-run owner receipt, author exclusions, scoped quota and reserve holds. Native subscription policy is valid in the ungoverned-pool fixture. Three focused groups, retries OFF: tier 27/0, eligibility 17/0, quota and ratio 103/0. Saved27 reconciles 25 passing and 2 previously exhausted accounting residuals. No broad rerun or live remediation claim.
